#concept-box("Carry this into Chapter 3")[
  Chapter 2 gives you a chain of events with names attached. Chapter 3 asks what those names are for. The same twelve chapters are read again, this time as a cast list — who stands where, what each person does to the plot, and which of them exists only to make Bepo's choice harder.
]

